<div>
  <p m="0" text="sm" font="700" text-primary>
    DATE CALCULATOR
  </p>
  <h2 m="0" mt="1" text="xl md:2xl" font="800">
    날짜 계산기
  </h2>
  <div grid="~ cols-1 md:cols-2" gap="4" mt="6">
    <label>
      <span class="cm-label">시작일</span>
      <input id="date-start" class="cm-input" type="date" />
    </label>
    <label>
      <span class="cm-label">종료일</span>
      <input id="date-end" class="cm-input" type="date" />
    </label>
  </div>
  <div
    id="date-result"
    mt="5"
    rounded="2xl"
    bg="surface-muted dark:dark-surface-subtle"
    p="5"
  >
    두 날짜를 선택하면 차이를 계산합니다.
  </div>
  <button id="date-calc" class="cm-button-primary" w="full" mt="4" py="3">
    계산하기
  </button>
</div>
